    "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:44:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-13T06:44:27Z",
    "body": "Hi, thanks for the feedback. I am however surprised by the potential security issues if this was limited to custom elements.\n\nJavaScript already allows for customElements.define('MyWidget', ...) , so I am genuinely wondering how much more security risk there would be if the parsing only avoided a tag.ToLower() before inserting to the DOM. Any security risk would come from JavaScript already today.",
